      "snippet": {
        "line": 461,
        "text": "theorem joined_after_match (F : Profile) (C T : ℝ) (li : ℝ → ℝ) (oldf oldU : Field)\n    {p : Point} (hp : matchFraction < p.1) :\n    joinedU F C T li oldf oldU p = F.U p ∧ joinedE F C T li oldf oldU p = F.E p"
